[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744575995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104429#issuecomment-2744575995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104429","id":2744575995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jluf7","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T22:19:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-22T18:25:12Z","body":"cc @BastiaanOlij \n\nThis is likely because the cameras that renders the ReflectionProbe inherits from the WorldEnvironment and its tonemapping. This can be fixed by always setting the tonemapping back to Linear, and also resetting the CameraEffects exposure override back to 1.0 while rendering the reflection probe. Of course, the existing Environment/CameraEffects resources should be duplicated first before changing their properties, so that the rest of the world rendering isn't affected.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744575995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2754012252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104429#issuecomment-2754012252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104429","id":2754012252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kJuRc","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T10:58:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T10:58:27Z","body":"@Calinou indeed, any post effects shouldn't effect reflection probes, they should only be applied on the final rendering result.\n\nThe reason this works properly in the Vulkan renderers is that we skip the post process logic for reflection probes and all these steps run in that part.\nWith the compatibility renderer we've moved tonemapping and exposure into the scene shader, but we have to make sure those steps do not happen for the reflection probe.\n\nI think changing the environment settings is dangerous here, we just need to make sure the tonemapping and expose settings aren't applied when rendering reflection probes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2754012252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763557385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104429#issuecomment-2763557385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104429","id":2763557385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kuIoJ","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T15:46:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T15:46:12Z","body":"It's reproducible on mobile by adjusting the exposure through camera-attributes. Not the _exact_ same I guess, since it does work as expected when adjusting tonemapper exposure there, but the end result is exactly the same: Refprobe reflections are too bright after recapturing. (The opposite is true too, reflections darken when with reduced exposure)\n\n| Before recapture | After recapture | After (tonemapper exp) |\n| - | - | - |\n| ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44092fdc-fc00-4f8c-ac41-b5bb109e5da7) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5eefa548-fd08-455c-ba98-f7cc6e2f53a8) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a5069cf-61d0-4582-8eb1-a42a2e28f610) |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763557385/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]